{"product_id":"tentacles-tales-of-the-giant-squid-step-into-reading","title":"Tentacles!: Tales of the Giant Squid (Step into Reading)","description":"\u003cp\u003eFor centuries, sailors have handed down stories of the giant squid. They say this mysterious monster of the deep chases ships and battles whales. They say it can weigh up to 1,000 pounds and that its eyes can be as big as a human head! Are these stories fact or fantasy? Find out in this exciting beginning reader.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 152 x 229\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Shirley Raye Redmond\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780375813078\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 48\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738270785689,"sku":"5RD9780375813078","price":10.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68cf96919b767_Tentacles_-_Tales_of_the_Giant_Squid__Step_into_Reading__Shirley_Raye_Redmond.jpg?v=1758560208","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/tentacles-tales-of-the-giant-squid-step-into-reading","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}